  "notes": {
    "title": "Spectator Inside 1.4.0",
    "markdown": "- Inside another player in spectator mode you now see their hotbar where yours would be, pieced together from what you see them hold, with their off-hand item and the name of each item they switch to.\n- While you're inside someone, the number keys, middle click and scroll wheel no longer open the spectator menu. Once you leave, they work as usual.\n- Fixed their hands sometimes sitting in the bottom middle of the screen."
  },
