      "version": "1.8.0+mc26.1-26.3",
      "description": "An all-in-one, client-side toolkit for CubeCraft: game timer, map and team layout, build limit, bridge lengths, spawn protection, item cooldowns, durability and drop protection, EggWars coach, clutch cues, supply HUD, shop discount, map briefing, AFK alarm, alt marker, hidden chest finder, party tools, auto GG, auto play and auto kit (your kit per map), chat alerts, stats, leaderboards, Discord presence, automatic clips through OBS and voting; plus zoom, freelook, fullbright, an armour HUD, ping numbers and more chat history for any server. Every feature can be switched on and off on its own.",
