    {
      "id": "spectatorinside",
      "name": "Spectator Inside",
      "version": "1.4.0",
      "description": "In spectator mode, left-click any player or mob (even from far away) to go inside their head, or hop between players with the arrow keys. See their hands and their hotbar, pieced together from what they hold, plus their health, keystrokes, combos, reach, opponent and kills on a HUD you can rearrange (press J). Works client-side; your body is teleported after them with the spectator menu's teleport, so they never drop out of view and you hear what they hear. Press Sneak to leave.",
      "group": "own",
